<title>UK: British Airways up as BZW sets 700p target.</title>
<headline>British Airways up as BZW sets 700p target.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British Airways Plc edged higher on Tuesday as analysts at BZW repeated a &quot;buy&quot; recommendation on the stock and set a price target of at least 700p, market sources said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 4-1/2p at 588-1/2 by 1314 GMT in active trade of 10 million shares -- making it the second most active FTSE 100 stock.</p>
</text>
